Description: Bluetooth Manager for palOS
 Turn Bluetooth on or off, pair and connect headphones, speakers, keyboards,
 mice, game controllers and phones, see their batteries, rename or forget them.
 A small helper answers pairing requests from other devices while the window
 is closed. In English and French. Replaces Blueman.
